This article covers the two tasks that come up when working with physical quantities: '''adding a unit''' to a quantity that already exists, and '''creating a new quantity''' that does not exist yet. It assumes you know what a characteristic is, see [[Item:OSW65734d3a98b1441da5ae8528107e9a5e|The characteristic building block system]].

